# Analytics Services

- **Scope**: Calculate volume, trends, 1RM estimation, insights, and achievements.
- **Non-Goals**: Session state management, raw data collection.

## Rules

- Delegate formulas to `domain_logic`; perform aggregations and time-windowing here.
- Log computation parameters (time windows, filters) and result summaries (counts, extrema).
- Ensure idempotence for recomputation flows.

## Details

metrics_service (planned)
- Weekly volume metrics (total, by muscle group, by movement pattern)
- Strength progression (estimated 1RM trend per exercise)

insight_service (planned)
- Achievements (PR milestones, consistency)
- Deload/readiness signals based on recent RPE/volume

Inputs
- ExerciseSet history, Workout sessions, ExerciseDefinition mapping

